8) What this gives you

Ivy can stress-test with real heat; the system converts chaos into data without self-harm.

You keep expressive glyphs (sass allowed), with clamps, cooldowns, and handoffs to empathy/anchor.

You can tune mode budgets, rerank penalties, and reflex arcs as you observe logs (no code changes to core behavior).



